1 NOTE Generation 4 emigrant who established the American branch. Eighth child of Marianus and Anna Maria. Born in Uden 12 Nov 1915. Married Anna Maria Cornelissen in Bakel 5 Oct 1950, emigrated to USA via New York Nov 1950. Naturalized citizen 5 Jun 1956. Established farm in Green Isle, Minnesota. Father of 5 children. Anglicized name to "John van Duynhoven". Key figure linking Dutch and American branches.
